                        ( Satellite (span 84 85) (rel2par evaluation-comment)
                          ( Satellite (leaf 84) (rel2par adversative-concession) (text _!Though there are a few draws for the traveler ,_!) )
                          ( Nucleus (leaf 85) (rel2par span) (text _!West Oakland is dominantly a very poor working - class residential neighborhood with a less than spectacular reputation ._!) )
